  "idea": "Notion 3.0 workspace automation updates and native database triggers",
  "text": "You no longer need external tools like Zapier for basic Notion workflows. Small teams waste hundreds monthly on connector subscriptions just to link internal project databases. Webhook failures and broken third-party syncs regularly freeze task boards without warning. Notion\u2019s native automation builder creates recurring pages, updates relational properties, and dispatches email alerts directly inside your workspace. You eliminate monthly software fees while keeping records perfectly synchronized.",
